    public function inspect(int$id):ResponseInterface{$u=$this->user();if(!$u)return$this->unauthorized();$c=$this->cfg['receipts'];$r=$this->row($c['table'],$id,$this->company($u));if(!$r)return$this->notFound();$in=$this->input();if($in===null||!isset($in['items'])||!is_array($in['items']))return$this->invalid(['items'=>'Inspection items are required.']);$response=$this->transaction(function()use($in,$id,$u,$c){$accepted=0;$rejected=0;foreach($in['items']as$x){$item=$this->row($c['items'],(int)($x['id']??0),$this->company($u));if(!$item||(int)$item['receipt_id']!==$id)throw new \RuntimeException('Invalid receipt item.');$a=(float)($x['accepted_qty']??0);$rj=(float)($x['rejected_qty']??0);if($a<0||$rj<0||abs(($a+$rj)-(float)$item['received_qty'])>0.0001)throw new \RuntimeException('Accepted and rejected quantity must equal received quantity.');$qs=(int)($x['quality_status_id']??0);if(!$this->active('material_receipt_items_quality_status_masters',$qs))throw new \RuntimeException('Invalid quality status.');db_connect()->table($c['items'])->where('id',$item['id'])->update(['accepted_qty'=>$a,'rejected_qty'=>$rj,'accepted_value'=>round($a*(float)$item['unit_rate'],2),'quality_status_id'=>$qs,'rejection_reason'=>$x['rejection_reason']??null,'updated_by'=>(int)$u->id]);$accepted+=$a;$rejected+=$rj;}$code=$accepted>0?($rejected>0?'PARTIALLY_ACCEPTED':'ACCEPTED'):'REJECTED';$sid=$this->masterId($c['status'],$c['status_col'],$code);db_connect()->table($c['table'])->where('id',$id)->update(['status_id'=>$sid,'inspected_by'=>(int)$u->id,'updated_by'=>(int)$u->id]);return$this->ok('Material receipt inspected successfully.',$c['key'],$this->row($c['table'],$id,$this->company($u)));},'Material receipt inspection failed.');if($response->getStatusCode()<400)$this->notify('receipts',$this->row($c['table'],$id,$this->company($u)),'INSPECTED',(int)$u->id);return$response;}
    public function postReceipt(int$id):ResponseInterface{$u=$this->user();if(!$u)return$this->unauthorized();$c=$this->cfg['receipts'];$r=$this->row($c['table'],$id,$this->company($u));if(!$r)return$this->notFound();if(!in_array($this->statusCode($c,$r),['ACCEPTED','PARTIALLY_ACCEPTED'],true))return$this->conflict('Only an accepted receipt can be posted.');$sid=$this->masterId($c['status'],$c['status_col'],'POSTED');db_connect()->table($c['table'])->where('id',$id)->update(['status_id'=>$sid,'posted_by'=>(int)$u->id,'posted_at'=>$this->now(),'updated_by'=>(int)$u->id]);$this->syncPoReceipt($id,$u);$fresh=$this->row($c['table'],$id,$this->company($u));$this->notify('receipts',$fresh,'POSTED',(int)$u->id);return$this->ok('Material receipt posted successfully.',$c['key'],$fresh);}
