    private function save(string$type,?int$id):ResponseInterface{$u=$this->user();if(!$u)return$this->unauthorized();$c=$this->config($type);if(!$c)return$this->notFound();$in=$this->input();if($in===null)return$this->invalid(['body'=>'A valid JSON request body is required.']);$company=$this->company($u);$old=$id?$this->row($c['table'],$id,$company):null;if($id&&!$old)return$this->notFound();if($old&&$this->statusCode($c,$old)!=='DRAFT')return$this->conflict('Only a DRAFT record can be updated.');$fields=$this->headerFields($type);$d=array_intersect_key($in,array_flip($fields));$m=array_merge($old??[],$d);$required=[$c['no'],$c['date'],'project_id'];if(in_array($type,['requests','purchase-orders','receipts'],true))$required[]='site_id';if(in_array($type,['purchase-orders','receipts'],true))$required[]='supplier_id';if($type==='transactions')$required[]='transaction_type_id';$e=$this->required($m,$required);if(isset($m['project_id'])&&!$this->project((int)$m['project_id'],$u))$e['project_id']='Select an accessible project.';if(isset($m['site_id'])&&!$this->site((int)$m['site_id'],(int)($m['project_id']??0),$u))$e['site_id']='Select a valid project site.';if(!empty($m['zone_id'])&&!$this->zone((int)$m['zone_id'],(int)($m['site_id']??0),$company))$e['zone_id']='Select a valid site zone.';if(isset($m['supplier_id'])&&!$this->row('material_suppliers',(int)$m['supplier_id'],$company))$e['supplier_id']='Select a valid supplier.';if($type==='transactions'&&!$this->active('material_transactions_transaction_type_masters',(int)($m['transaction_type_id']??0)))$e['transaction_type_id']='Select a valid transaction type.';$dup=db_connect()->table($c['table'])->where(['company_id'=>$company,$c['no']=>$m[$c['no']]??''])->where('deleted_at',null);if($id)$dup->where('id !=',$id);if($dup->countAllResults())$e[$c['no']]='Number already exists.';if($e)return$this->invalid($e);if(!$id){$d['status_id']=$this->masterId($c['status'],$c['status_col'],'DRAFT');$d+=['company_id'=>$company,'crea