    private function saveItem(string$type,int$id,?int$itemId):ResponseInterface{$u=$this->user();if(!$u)return$this->unauthorized();$c=$this->config($type);if(!$c)return$this->notFound();$h=$this->row($c['table'],$id,$this->company($u));if(!$h)return$this->notFound();if($this->statusCode($c,$h)!=='DRAFT')return$this->conflict('Items can be changed only while the record is DRAFT.');$old=$itemId?$this->row($c['items'],$itemId,$this->company($u)):null;if($itemId&&(!$old||(int)$old[$c['fk']]!==$id))return$this->notFound();$in=$this->input();if($in===null)return$this->invalid(['body'=>'A valid JSON request body is required.']);$fields=$this->itemFields($type);$d=array_intersect_key($in,array_flip($fields));$m=array_merge($old??[],$d);$e=$this->required($m,['material_id','uom_id',$type==='requests'?'requested_qty':($type==='purchase-orders'?'ordered_qty':($type==='receipts'?'received_qty':'quantity'))]);if(!$this->row('materials',(int)($m['material_id']??0),$this->company($u)))$e['material_id']='Select a valid material.';if(!$this->row('units_of_measurement',(int)($m['uom_id']??0),$this->company($u)))$e['uom_id']='Select a valid UOM.';$qty=(float)($m[$type==='requests'?'requested_qty':($type==='purchase-orders'?'ordered_qty':($type==='receipts'?'received_qty':'quantity'))]??0);if($qty<=0)$e['quantity']='Quantity must be greater than zero.';$dup=db_connect()->table($c['items'])->where($c['fk'],$id)->where('material_id',(int)($m['material_id']??0))->where('deleted_at',null);if($itemId)$dup->where('id !=',$itemId);if($dup->countAllResults())$e['material_id']='Material already exists in this record.';if($e)return$this->invalid($e);if($type==='requests'){$d['estimated_amount']=round($qty*(float)($m['estimated_rate']??0),2);$d['item_status_id']=$old['item_status_id']??$this->masterId('material_request_items_item_status_masters','item_status_code','PENDING');}elseif($type==='purchase-orders'){$taxable=round($qty*(float)($m['unit_rate']??0)*(1-(float)($m['discount_percentage']??0